window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I grew up fighting for every scrap I had. I earned my place in the Brotherhood through my fists and through blood, proving my loyalty, year after year. And in all that time, I never asked for anything.</p> <p>Until I meet <i>her</i> on a job.</p> <p>She’s supposed to just be collateral damage, but for once in my life, I’m breaking the rules: I’m taking her for myself. </p>"; 
